# - __pycache__ / *.pyc: written by Python automatically
# - data: recorded takes are shared outside git (team decision, 2026-11-18)
# - logs: GUI logs; attach a specific log as test evidence when one is asked for
# - training/runs: training run folders (owner, 2026-11-22); keep the ones
#   worth keeping elsewhere
# - training/sample_data: rebuilt from a fixed seed by training/make_sample_set.py
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
data/
logs/
training/runs/
